1_26_The Test of the Oracle_When the player attempts to speak to the Oracle, the Oracle will first ask the player to prove their worth. They will tell the player: “I am treacherous, deep, and vast. Many have crossed me, both now and in the past. What am I?”_Ocean_2
2_22_The Shaman's Seal_A magic seal has been placed on the entrance to Tartarus. In order to gain entrance, the player must display their esoteric knowledge of light and dark by answering the following question: “I have long aided humanity to fight the rising odds; I am the weapon that can kill the Gods. What am I?”_Spear_2
3_28_The Gates of the Acropolis_A magic seal has been placed on the grand entrance to the Acropolis. In order for the player to progress to the next area, they must answer the following riddle: “I am the original Fire, the source of all Light. When at last I extinguish, an unending night. What am I?”_The Sun_2
4_12_The Archmage's Seal_In the archives, the exit from Floor 2 leading to the top has been sealed by some magic. The door to the top floor of the archives is glowing with a menacing aura, and there appear to be 2 snakes wrapped around the door handles. One moves toward the player and speaks: “I am the final rest, the end of the line. Should you reject or embrace me, the choice is thine. What am I?”_Death_2
5_26_Unlit Sconce_There are two sconces on either side of a door; one is lit while the other is not. The door is sealed shut by some magic, preventing the player from entering the Forest on Oracle Island. When the player attempts to travel through the door to the adjacent room, a message will appear: “The door is sealed shut by some magic. There are two sconces on either side of the door; one is lit while the other is not. What will you do?”_Light_2
6_4_Vulcan's Mechanism_In the Mines entrance, there is a lock placed on the door leading North to the quarry. It is an elaborate and ornate mechanism of some kind placed by Vulcan, patron God of Blacksmiths. When the player attempts to move North to the Quarry, the player will notice the mechanism locking the gate to the Quarry. The player will then hear a disembodied voice: “If you seek to move forward on your journey, first you must complete this mental tourney. I wait in the shadows; my body is curled. When the time is right, I shall devour the World. What am I?”_Snake_2
7_15_Ancestral Knowledge_When the player reaches the Ancestral Woods: Thicket, they will be engulfed in a thick fog. The player will hear the disembodied voice of the Ancestors say: “I am pointless, endless, and will go on forevermore. I bring countless futures lost, and end lives by the scores. What am I?_War_2